<title>UK: Egypt buys 28,000 tonnes sunflower oil - trade.</title>
<headline>Egypt buys 28,000 tonnes sunflower oil - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egypt bought 28,000 tonnes of sunflower oil for second half August shipment at $560.50 a tonne c and f at its tender on Wednesday, European traders said. --Jim Ballantyne, London Newsroom, +44 171 542 8062</p>
</text>
